      "title": "A bit small",
      "review_text": "I’m not sure if these balls are just specifically for toddlers or smaller children. And I say this because they run small. Not the regular size of a volleyball or soccer ball. Maybe this is why they come two in a pack. But other than that they are nice balls. They come with a air pump. Which is nice because the balls are shipped deflated. It’s easy to blow up. Once blown up they bounce pretty good and seem to be of decent quality. It’s pretty firm yet could be a bit softer for use as a volleyball. I thought they could be used for both. But a soccer ball would be it’s best use. Easy for holding but not as comfortable to grip. I would get different balls for adults or teens. But I think these balls are perfect for kids.",
